    Slackware
    Androidx86
    Puppy
    Peppermint
    Tails
    AntiX
    Kali
    SparkyLinux
    Apricity
    BlackLab
    Bodhi
    TrueOS
    ArchBang
    KaOS
    WattOS
    Korora
    Simplicity
    RemixOS
    OpenMandriva
    Netrunner
    Alpine
    BlackArch
    Ultimate
    Gecko
    Parrot
    KNOPPIX
    GhostBSD
    Sabayon
    Salix
    Q4OS
    ClearOS
    Container
    ROSA
    Zenwalk
    Parabola
    ChaletOS
    BackBox
    MXLinux
    Vector
    Maui
    Qubes
    RancherOS
    Oracle
    TinyCore
    Robolinux
    Trisquel
    Voyager
    Clonezilla
    SteamOS
    Absolute
    NixOS                       ## NixOS or a Nix build environment
    AUSTRUMI
    Arya
    Porteus
    AVLinux
    Elive
    Bluestar
    SliTaz
    Solaris
    Chakra
    Wifislax
    Scientific
